# Git attributes for RewardAgentAnalysis
# 强制 LF 换行,避免 Windows 下 commit 时被自动转 CRLF(Git 会输出警告)

# 默认所有文本文件使用 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理文件保留 CRLF(脚本兼容)
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 明确标记二进制文件,避免 diff 误判
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
